<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RGC sees 96/97 profit more than halved.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RGC sees 96/97 profit more than halved.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miner RGC Ltd said on Thursday it expected net profit for the 1996/97 (July-June) year to be less than half of the A$76.5 million achieved in the 1995/96 year.</p>
<p>RGC said it also plans to write down A$50 million on the Thalanga base metals mine in Queensland and a A$30 million writedown on its Renison tin mine in Tasmania.</p>
</text>
